# Agent instructions

Read `README.md` first for information about the repository.

## Code and verification

This is a personal AI agent configuration repository, not an app.
Write simple, minimal changes.
Prefer existing patterns and frontmatter conventions.
Do not add unrequested skills, rules, or tools.
After you finish, sanity-check what you changed (skill/rule frontmatter, and that paths in `install.conf.yaml` still make sense).

## Installation

Local setup is via `./install` (dotbot).
In cloud, `.cursor/install.sh` links this checkout into `~/.cursor`.
Prefer editing configs and verifying by inspection.
